# Native OCCT static slices are fetched and verified by bootstrap.py from the
# pinned upstream Git-LFS objects recorded in DEPENDENCIES.json. Both exceed the
# ordinary Git block-push limit and must not be committed as blobs; the OCCT
# headers and Info.plist stay Git-tracked.
Vendor/OCCT.xcframework/**/*.a
